            "description": "# Image-Clustering\r\n\r\nA simple Python library for image clustering using K-means\r\n\r\n## Installation\r\n\r\nInstall via pip:\r\n```python\r\npip install Image-clustering\r\n```\r\n\r\n\r\n\r\n## Usage\r\n\r\n```python\r\nimport cv2\r\nfrom image_clustering import image_clustering\r\n\r\nimage_path = \"path/to/your/image.jpg\"\r\nn_clusters = 5\r\n\r\nsegmented_image = image_clustering(image_path, n_clusters)\r\ncv2.imwrite(\"output.jpg\", segmented_image)\r\n```\r\nLicense\r\nMIT License\r\n",
